# The builder image of every component, pinned by DIGEST (a manifest-list digest of the Fedora release the binaries go into).
# Shared by all components: a new digest changes the key of every component and rebuilds them all.
# Re-resolve: skopeo inspect --raw docker://registry.fedoraproject.org/fedora:45 | sha256sum
BUILDER=registry.fedoraproject.org/fedora:45@sha256:e15959f36d52307f176f8c068009f6f1451c3b238b37a1f03e56dbfa4526e8b1
